		"description": {
			"public": "<p><strong>Gadget</strong> &middot; <em>Engineer invention powered by Toolbelt scraps. Activate for 1 scrap; spend a 2nd scrap for the Toolbelt effect. Only Engineers gain the active benefit &mdash; an ally given this gadget gains only the Passive.</em></p><hr><p><strong>Free Reaction, 1/Safe Rest (1 scrap):</strong> When you would drop to 0 HP, you instead drop to 1, then Burst 1, Damage LVL Lightning and gain Charged. Ignores armor.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt (2 scraps):</strong> Restore INT+LVL HP.</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> Max Wounds increase by 1.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Using the gadget spends 1 Toolbelt scrap and its 1/Safe Rest use — tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[A] Spends the AED's 1/Safe Rest use and rolls Burst 1, LVL Lightning (ignores armor).</em></p><p><em>[A] The Toolbelt upgrade is the separate \"AED (Toolbelt)\" feature (2 scraps total); the passive lives on the \"AED\" gadget feature, so it works even if this item is unequipped.</em></p><p><em>[A] Keep the gadget equipped: Nimble switches off an unequipped object's rules, so its scrap cost would not be charged.</em></p><p><em>[M] Set your HP to 1 instead of 0 and give yourself Charged.</em></p>",
